      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The shame you're feeling is a heavy burden, but it's a powerful, isolating feeling, and I hear how deeply that humiliation is affecting you. Instead of letting the momentum carry you toward that imagined bottom, perhaps you could focus on just the next small moment. Even one tiny, manageable step forward, no matter how small, can disrupt the feeling of unstoppable downward motion. There are people who can help you navigate these intense feelings of worthlessness.",
      "source": "target",
